NOTICE — scope of this license.

This MIT license covers the CODE in this repository (`src/`, `scripts/`) and the
LaTeX source of the paper. It does NOT cover:

  * The GRAPE dataset. GRAPE is © its authors and is distributed on Figshare
    (collection 6406319) under its own terms; obtain it there. The committed
    files under `data/derived/` are aggregate statistics and derived labels
    computed from GRAPE (no images, no patient-identifying information).

  * The published papers audited in this work. Their PDFs are copyrighted and
    are deliberately not included; see the reference list in the paper.
